-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting (Exemption) (No. 2) (Amendment) Order 2022 (S 212/2022), made under s 60 of the Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-exemption-no-2-amendment-order-2022/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S212-2022.txt (e-Gazette PDF, pdftotext -layout).
-- The Order says "Made on 22 March 2022" and "First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 25 March 2022 at 5 pm".
-- It has no commencement clause of its own: the "wef 25/03/2022" printed against sub-paragraph (a) in the O 2 deposit is the consolidation's note, and it is the publication day.
-- What it changes: sub-paragraph (a) of paragraph 2 of the Exemption (No. 2) Order (O 2) is deleted.
-- O 2 exempts named broadcasting holding companies from section 33 of the Act; no receiver is within it.

§ `Made, published, in operation`

-- src:25 | Made on 22 March 2022.
@ref the day the Order was made (src:25)
`S 212/2022 was made on` MEANS Date 22 3 2022

-- src:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 25 March 2022 at 5 pm.
@ref first publication (src:3)
`S 212/2022 was first published on` MEANS Date 25 3 2022

-- ASSUMED, NOT RULED: the Order takes effect on its publication day, not on the day it was made.
-- The rule used is the Interpretation Act 1965's, quoted below: this is the consolidation in force from 5 December 2025, and the text in force in March 2022 was not deposited.
-- src:IA1965:1259 | Commencement of subsidiary legislation
-- src:IA1965:1261 | 23.—(1) Subsidiary legislation made under any Act or other lawful
-- src:IA1965:1262 | authority —
-- src:IA1965:1264 | (a) unless it is otherwise expressly provided in any Act, must
-- src:IA1965:1265 | be published in the Gazette; and
-- src:IA1965:1267 | (b) unless it is otherwise provided in the subsidiary legislation,
-- src:IA1965:1268 | takes effect and comes into operation on the date of its
-- src:IA1965:1269 | publication.
@ref Interpretation Act 1965, Commencement of subsidiary legislation (src:IA1965:1259-1269)
`S 212/2022 takes effect on` MEANS Date 25 3 2022

